    The picture of a person or, when there is none, their initials, as Moodle draws them.

    @copyright  2026 Didactika.org
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "fullname": "Jane Doe",
        "hasimage": false,
        "imageurl": "",
        "initials": "JD",
        "size": 35
    }
}}
